R:pilot
R:@tier engine
R:@desc in-level PILOT runs in-engine — the player's {Script} ramps GOLD past its 1234 sentinel
R:@level pilot_demo-standalone.iff
R:@needs player as #P
R:@expect-exit 0
R:@expect-out PASS
R:@screenshot pilot_demo.png
PS:
WA:#P GOLD
ST:60
WM:#P GOLD > 1234 timeout 6.0
M:#last > 1234
SH:pilot_demo.png
ST:1
TY:PASS — in-level PILOT executed; player GOLD=$#last (1234 sentinel + ramp)
TN:FAIL — player GOLD=$#last; in-level PILOT did not run
JN:*fail
E:
*fail
EX:1
